        {
          "id": 1697546966,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I've just tested migration with Firefox, by walking from one Wi-Fi to the next, the decryption works since it uses a source CID. However, Firefox does also reuse CIDs after Migration. So it's not that uncommon.\n\nTested with Firefox: 120.0.1 (64-bit) on arch\n[firefox.pcapng](/uploads/2962bf5465cc41521361ad4e1f16c3b4/firefox.pcapng)",
